# head/adult/man/long: the man's Long head: narrow, a tall crown and the chin a row lower (6 px)
# P2b FACES (wave 2). Every head type keeps A3's eye rows and columns, the nose pixel and the mouth row
# (STYLE_P2 4), so expressions, marks and paint fit them all. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body man
role head long
layer head
anchor head
keys rest

view D key rest origin -1 -2
mark face 2 6
